PROPRIETARY USE LICENSE — ArnesJuan
Copyright (c) 2026 SysVEGA (Juan Vega). All rights reserved.

This software is NOT open source. It is published in a public repository for
distribution convenience only.

GRANTED: You may download, install and run ArnesJuan for internal use,
including within your own commercial projects and client work, at no cost,
and keep reasonable backup copies.

NOT GRANTED: You may not redistribute, publish, sell, rent, sublicense or
otherwise make the Software available to third parties; host mirrors or
alternative marketplaces of it; create derivative works, modified versions or
products based on it; incorporate it into any product, tool, platform or
service offered to third parties; reverse engineer it to reproduce its
functionality elsewhere; remove copyright or attribution notices; or use the
"ArnesJuan" or "SysVEGA" names or marks to promote your own offerings.

For the avoidance of doubt: configuring the Software through its project
state files (AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md and the templates installed in your own
repository) is Internal Use, not a derivative work.

FORKS: The hosting platform's fork feature is permitted solely to prepare
contributions back to the Licensor's repository, and the fork must be deleted
afterwards. Contributions submitted to the Licensor are irrevocably assigned
to the Licensor.

NO WARRANTY. The Software is provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind.
The Licensor is not liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special,
punitive or consequential damages. The Software orchestrates AI agents that
generate and modify code; you alone are responsible for reviewing and
validating any output before production use.

TERMINATION: This license terminates automatically upon breach of the
restrictions above.

GOVERNING LAW: Republic of Costa Rica; courts of San José, Costa Rica.

Commercial licenses covering redistribution, derivative works or third-party
integration are available separately: https://sysvega.cr

In case of discrepancy, the Spanish version above prevails.
